# 📱 AI Apps Repository / Repositorio de Apps con IA

> Applications, prototypes, tools, and experiments built with or around artificial intelligence.  
> Aplicaciones, prototipos, herramientas y experimentos creados con o alrededor de inteligencia artificial.

---

## 🇬🇧 English

## About this section

This section of the repository is focused on apps, tools, prototypes, scripts, and experimental projects created with the help of artificial intelligence.

The goal is to explore how AI can be used to build useful digital products, automate tasks, improve productivity, support learning, and create new ideas faster.

Some apps may be simple experiments, while others may become more complete projects over time.

---

## What kind of apps will be included?

This repository may include:

- AI-powered web apps
- Productivity tools
- Automation scripts
- Developer utilities
- Chatbots and assistants
- Prompt-based applications
- Educational tools
- Experimental prototypes
- APIs and integrations
- Small apps made to test ideas

